  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>nRTln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>nRTln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>nRTln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>nRT</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>nRTln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>nRTln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>mx</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math><br /><br />So for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> Intercept of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> would be more negative than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and slope of curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> would be more than slope of curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></math> ."
